{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"3243e59268202abf129631afefba5ab8ed90087094ffa3376914f758c5624ef5"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:1cfbe0074a11fd87140c9e1b04c887f55cf6b6a7d89d22dd014154fedd11b8aa","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"It motivates others to learn about car mechanics","evidence":"[D28:10 | 5:46 pm on 2 November, 2023] Dave: Thanks, Calvin! It's awesome people are checking out my blog and asking me for advice. I recently posted about how I made this car look like a beast, and it was great to hear it inspired others to start their own DIY projects.","itemId":"urn:uuid:a69a1704-7ce9-5e2a-aaea-f650db68c5cf","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:a36dd4631889ee119aa3291e1e1cb103735c7dcf34301294881e5b5e94937c0b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of impact does Dave's blog on car mods have on people?","referenceAnswer":"It inspires others to start their DIY projects","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"a36dd4631889ee119aa3291e1e1cb103735c7dcf34301294881e5b5e94937c0b"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}